---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Deck from '../../../components/defence/Deck.astro';
---
<Base title="The defence, slide by slide" description="The slides of my public PhD defence on cellular automata and network automata, every one live: step through them here, or present them fullscreen with a clicker." wide>
  <div class="measure">
    <h1>The defence, slide by slide</h1>
    <p>
      On Friday 2 October 2026 I defend my PhD thesis, <em>The rich landscape of iterated simplicity:
      cellular automata and network automata</em>, in a public talk of about 35 minutes. These are its
      slides. Each one is live: step through its builds with the arrows under it, drag and click where it
      invites you to, or present the whole talk fullscreen. The thesis itself, chapter by chapter, is on <a href="/demos/thesis/">its own page</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="present">
      <button type="button" data-present="deck">Present</button>
      <a href="/demos/defence/rollier-defence.html" download>offline version (one file)</a>
      <span>clicker or PageDown and PageUp · b blanks · q leaves</span>
    </p>
  </div>
  <Deck mode="page" />
</Base>

<style>
  .present { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.5rem 1rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; }
  .present button {
    font: inherit; font-size: 1rem; color: var(--bg); background: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 0.4em 1.4em; cursor: pointer; touch-action: manipulation;
  }
  .present button:hover { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); }
</style>
